@baseUrl = http://localhost:5003
@userId = 1
@applicationId = 1
@reminderId = 1

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List reminders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders

### List reminders for a user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/user/{{userId}}

### Create a reminder; copy its returned id into reminderId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "applicationId": {{applicationId}},
  "title": "Prepare for interview",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-04T15:00:00Z",
  "completed": false
}

### Read a reminder
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/{{reminderId}}

### Replace editable reminder fields and mark completed
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/{{reminderId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "applicationId": {{applicationId}},
  "title": "Prepare for interview",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-04T15:00:00Z",
  "completed": true
}

### Delete a reminder
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/{{reminderId}}

